{
  "about": "A profile's avatar on every app (docs/THEMES.md, \"Profile colors\"): its picture; without one, or when it fails, a circle in its avatar_color (#rgb or #rrggbb, any case); without a valid one, colors[h % 8], h the name's code points folded as h = (h * 31 + code point) mod 2^32 from 0. On it, the trimmed name's first code point in capitals ('?' for none), in whichever of ink.dark and ink.light has the higher WCAG contrast with the circle (dark on a tie).",
